WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
[Technician Priya] Hi, this is Priya. I checked your front brakes today.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The pad on the left is yours. It is worn down to about 2 millimetres.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.500
A new pad, on the right, is about 10 millimetres thick.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.000
I also measured your tire tread. It is 6 millimetres, so your tires are fine.
